			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): bump Effect-TS dependencies and refine README diagram\n\nThis commit updates the Cocoon extension host to the latest Effect-TS stack versions and makes minor documentation improvements.\n\n### Dependency Updates\n- **Effect Core**: Lifted `effect` (3.20.0 → 3.21.0), `@effect/platform` (0.95.0 → 0.96.0), and `@effect/platform-node` (0.105.0 → 0.106.0) to incorporate latest runtime optimizations for the declarative services layer.\n- **Effect Extras**: Bumped `@effect/experimental` (0.59.0 → 0.60.0), `@effect/language-service` (0.80.0 → 0.81.0), and `@effect/opentelemetry` (0.62.0 → 0.63.0) for improved language server integration and observability support.\n\n### Documentation\n- Added 🏗️ emoji to \"System Architecture Diagram\" heading for better visual engagement\n- Aligned Mountain subgraph label formatting with the rest of the diagram\n\nThese updates ensure the Cocoon extension host remains synchronized with the upstream Effect-TS ecosystem while maintaining compatibility with the Land project's architecture.",
